  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Higher Education for 90 Andean Young People</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Do you think it&apos;s fair that where you live dictates your level of education? In Peru, young people from rural areas are far less likely to complete higher education than their urban peers, due to lack of financial resources, preparation, and support. Our Transitions Project enables indigenous young people from the Andes to become the first in their families to study after secondary school, leading to better employment opportunities and empowering them to break the poverty cycle.</narrative>
  </description>
